<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-U9-010>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-U9-010" ;
  triage:title "atm-graft crate-level doc comment does not mention advisory stream ownership" ;
  triage:description "The atm-graft crate-level doc comment (crates/atm-graft/src/lib.rs:1) reads only '//! Thin embedded ATM client crate for graft-aware host agents.' It does not mention the live advisory stream owned by this crate (GraftSession's persistent receive thread over GraftLocalIpcClientTransport), which is the primary U.9 deliverable." ;
